# PR merge conflicts (cursor-packs)

When creating a pull request, or when the branch / PR cannot merge cleanly into its base:

1. Load `.cursor/skills/resolve-pr-merge-conflicts/SKILL.md` and follow its constraints.
2. Detect and resolve conflicts against the base before treating the PR as ready.
3. Prefer merging the base into the feature branch; do not force-push unless the user explicitly asks.
